  "prefLabel": "En 2103.03 Annual Certifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2103.03 Annual Certifications. No later than July 1 of each year subsequent to filing its initial compliance plan, a utility shall:\n\n(a) Certify that its compliance plan continues to meet the requirements of En 2103, Puc 2100, and RSA 366; and\n\n(b) If necessary, file an updated compliance plan which meets the requirements of En 2103.04.\n\nSource. #14519, eff 2-26-26, EXPIRES: 2-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en2100.html"
